    "explanation": "Reduced sizeof(LZ4F_dctx) by 48 in calloc, truncating the blockChecksum XXH32_state and part of the xxh content checksum state. Heap-buffer-overflow when LZ4F_decompress writes to the XXH32 state or processes frame header bytes into the truncated region."
  },
